{{otheruses|the NPC|the summon|Raptor (summon)}}
[[Raptor]]s are agile [[Dinosaur]]s found in the [[Tarnished Coast]]. Non-boss raptors tend to be less threatening than other dinosaurs due to their lack of [[Twisting Jaws]] and an [[elite skill]], although [[Critical Defenses]] and [[Disrupting Stab]] give them strong resilience and loads of interrupts.

